    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Every consignment above the exempted value must be accompanied by a GST e‑Way bill generated on the government portal. The bill records the consignor, consignee, transport mode, and the exact value of goods. It is a legal requirement under the Goods and Services Tax Act and must be presented to customs or police checkpoints during transit.</p>
