    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Indian Builders Association (IBA) certifies the LR/Bilty as the proof of receipt and hand‑over of goods. It details the type, quantity, weight, and condition of items at the point of loading. Both the shipper and the carrier sign the document, creating a binding contract that can be used in case of disputes.</p>
